cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "proxymix: Gaussian Mixture Proxies for Densities and Characteristic Functions"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Max
    family-names: Moldovan
    email: max.moldovan@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9680-8474"
  - given-names: John
    family-names: Hoek
    name-particle: van der
    email: john.vanderhoek@adelaide.edu.au
abstract: >-
  An R package fitting multivariate Gaussian-mixture proxies to target
  distributions given by a density, by samples, or by a characteristic
  function. Four regimes are unified under one verb: closed-form moment
  matching, classical EM on samples, importance-sampled EM against a target
  that can only be evaluated, and a least-squares fit to a characteristic
  function.
